      "role": "user",
      "content": "exactly. it's just a hollow existence. people talk about \"moving on\" like it's some kind of triumph, but for me, it just feels like being forced to live a lie. everything i was worked for is just... gone. and the worst part is that i don't even want to try to rebuild anything. it feels like the natural conclusion to everything is just to stop. like, if the story is already over, why keep turning the pages?",
